      "i go workout in a gym in a beautiful neighborhood, i look in the mirror and i appreciate how i look, how god made my face, how i used to see a chubby sweet goofy kid and now i see an excited strong leaner young man that is wide-eyed and disciplined and creative, i see a much more seasoned human that feels connected to the beauty of youth, i see possibility and potential, i see a clean haircut and a great smile and a smooth face after i decided to take better care of my self and learn from my little sister, i feel vital and happy and when i look in the mirror, i see the truth.",
      "i eat food that is good for me, i cook for myself and find joy in the routine of the same breakfast i’ve eaten since i was 12 when my mom first made it for me, i see that rituals are just a way for us to take slices of space and time and make ourselves feel at home. every morning my cup of coffee, my omelet and toast with avocado, my jog to the gym, the skincare routine safia helped me find and the margiela jazz club parfum i put on, these make me feel so good.",
